Query:
-- Description: 2) Bring in the raw README text by joining SAMPLE_FILES → SAMPLE_CONTENTS on the object id
SELECT 
  f."repo_name",
  f."path",
  c."content"
FROM GITHUB_REPOS.GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_FILES  AS f
JOIN GITHUB_REPOS.GITHUB_REPOS.SAMPLE_CONTENTS AS c
  ON c."id" = f."id"
WHERE f."path" ILIKE '%README.md'
LIMIT 20;
Answer:
repo_name,path,content
